node.text:
Hah! Sure are! I knew yah couldn't resist, ya' softshells are just so strange!
Ya know w'at, 'ere. Next time you see a shell that strokes them 'love-chords', of yours, just spritz a little bit of this on'ye self before ya say hello!
{{yellow|*Ditzy-Fly gives you several winks with their many eyes. Before handing you a vial of strangely flourescent liquid.*}}

{{yellow|*They break their eyes away, gaze only flickering to you for a short moment, Arshira seems almost annoyed*}}
I know enough to keep me alive. Enough to hone this monsterish body of mine into a weapon worth its edge. The past is a dark, dirt-path leading to places you’ve already looted and seen. There’s nothing to be got, naught but nostalgia.
I prefer to look forward.

Dangerous would be a costly underestimation. Bethesda Susa is truly a duality amongst intrigue and horror, magnificent sights and treacherous evocations.
Hm. But. Maybe …
{{yellow|*Iseppa seems to be contemplating something*}}
